{"id":"vd-a2-the-dog-walker","level":"a2","n":20,"title":{"en":"How Often Does He Go Out?","vi":"Nó ra ngoài bao lâu một lần?"},"summary":"Buổi gặp đầu tiên: Mia hỏi bà Kowalski về thói quen hằng ngày của chú chó Biscuit trước khi nhận việc.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a2-the-dog-walker","level":"a2","title":{"en":"The Dog Walker","vi":"Cô bé dắt chó thuê"}},"scene":{"background":"home-day","props":[{"id":"puppy","x":820}]},"cast":{"mia":{"name":{"en":"Mia","vi":"Mia"},"look":"teengirl","x":500,"style":{"hair":"ponytail","hairColor":"#5A3825","outfit":"tee","top":"#F28C38","topShade":"#D97826"}},"kowalski":{"name":{"en":"Mrs. Kowalski","vi":"Bà Kowalski"},"look":"grandma","x":1150,"style":{"outfit":"cardigan","top":"#8E6FB5","topShade":"#77599C"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"kowalski","en":"I saw your advertisement in my mailbox. This is Biscuit.","vi":"Bà thấy tờ quảng cáo của cháu trong hộp thư. Đây là Biscuit.","ipa":["aɪ","sɔ","jɔɹ","ædˈvɝtəzmənt","ɪn","maɪ","ˈmeɪlˌbɑks","ðɪs","ɪz","ˈbɪskət"],"start":0.554,"end":4.814,"expression":"happy","prop":"puppy","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,0.657],[2,0.936],[3,1.162],[4,1.907],[5,1.986],[6,2.133],[7,3.878],[8,4.157],[9,4.303]]},{"speaker":"mia","en":"Hello, Biscuit! Oh, he's so sweet.","vi":"Chào Biscuit! Ôi, nó dễ thương quá.","ipa":["həˈloʊ","ˈbɪskət","oʊ","hiz","soʊ","swit"],"start":5.604,"end":9.134,"expression":"happy","gesture":"wave","timing":[[0,5.604],[1,6.268],[2,7.689],[3,8.167],[4,8.436],[5,8.731]]},{"speaker":"mia","en":"How often does he go out?","vi":"Nó ra ngoài bao lâu một lần ạ?","ipa":["haʊ","ˈɔfən","dʌz","hi","ɡoʊ","aʊt"],"start":9.674,"end":11.054,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,9.674],[1,9.86],[2,10.277],[3,10.485],[4,10.608],[5,10.828]]},{"speaker":"kowalski","en":"Twice a day. At eight in the morning and at five.","vi":"Hai lần một ngày. Lúc tám giờ sáng và lúc năm giờ.","ipa":["twaɪs","ə","deɪ","æt","eɪt","ɪn","ðə","ˈmɔɹnɪŋ","ənd","æt","faɪv"],"start":11.844,"end":15.414,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,11.844],[1,12.15],[2,12.229],[3,13.576],[4,13.842],[5,14.068],[6,14.147],[7,14.214],[8,14.693],[9,14.799],[10,14.932]]},{"speaker":"mia","en":"And how long is each walk?","vi":"Còn mỗi lần đi dạo bao lâu ạ?","ipa":["ənd","haʊ","lɔŋ","ɪz","itʃ","wɔk"],"start":16.204,"end":17.754,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,16.204],[1,16.327],[2,16.572],[3,16.94],[4,17.099],[5,17.344]]},{"speaker":"kowalski","en":"Usually about half an hour. He's quite slow.","vi":"Thường khoảng nửa tiếng. Nó chậm lắm.","ipa":["ˈjuʒəwəli","əˈbaʊt","hæf","æn","ˈaʊɚ","hiz","kwaɪt","sloʊ"],"start":18.544,"end":22.124,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,18.544],[1,18.976],[2,19.255],[3,19.534],[4,19.654],[5,21.053],[6,21.319],[7,21.639]]},{"speaker":"mia","en":"Does he ever run?","vi":"Nó có bao giờ chạy không ạ?","ipa":["dʌz","hi","ˈɛvɚ","ɹʌn"],"start":22.914,"end":23.954,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,22.914],[1,23.086],[2,23.282],[3,23.625]]},{"speaker":"kowalski","en":"Hardly ever. Only when he sees a cat.","vi":"Hầu như không bao giờ. Chỉ khi thấy mèo thôi.","ipa":["ˈhɑɹdli","ˈɛvɚ","ˈoʊnli","wɛn","hi","siz","ə","kæt"],"start":24.744,"end":28.024,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,24.744],[1,25.146],[2,26.559],[3,26.918],[4,27.064],[5,27.184],[6,27.476],[7,27.556]]},{"speaker":"mia","en":"Does he like cats?","vi":"Nó thích mèo ạ?","ipa":["dʌz","hi","laɪk","kæts"],"start":28.814,"end":29.954,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,28.814],[1,28.976],[2,29.111],[3,29.405]]},{"speaker":"kowalski","en":"No! He's afraid of them. He runs away.","vi":"Không! Nó sợ mèo. Nó bỏ chạy đấy.","ipa":["noʊ","hiz","əˈfɹeɪd","ʌv","ðɛm","hi","ɹʌnz","əˈweɪ"],"start":30.744,"end":35.144,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,30.744],[1,32.2],[2,32.452],[3,32.878],[4,32.984],[5,34.208],[6,34.394],[7,34.7]]},{"speaker":"mia","en":"Oh dear. How often does he eat?","vi":"Ôi trời. Nó ăn bao lâu một lần ạ?","ipa":["oʊ","dɪɹ","haʊ","ˈɔfən","dʌz","hi","it"],"start":35.934,"end":38.704,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,35.934],[1,36.106],[2,37.392],[3,37.649],[4,38.053],[5,38.311],[6,38.507]]},{"speaker":"kowalski","en":"Every morning and every evening. And he gets one biscuit on Sundays.","vi":"Mỗi sáng và mỗi tối. Chủ nhật được thêm một cái bánh quy.","ipa":["ˈɛvɚi","ˈmɔɹnɪŋ","ənd","ˈɛvɚi","ˈivnɪŋ","ənd","hi","ɡɛts","wʌn","ˈbɪskət","ɑn","ˈsʌnˌdeɪz"],"start":39.494,"end":44.254,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,39.494],[1,39.763],[2,40.242],[3,40.401],[4,40.72],[5,42.173],[6,42.319],[7,42.426],[8,42.665],[9,42.944],[10,43.343],[11,43.529]]},{"speaker":"mia","en":"Only once a week? Poor Biscuit!","vi":"Chỉ một lần một tuần thôi ạ? Tội nghiệp Biscuit!","ipa":["ˈoʊnli","wʌns","ə","wik","puɹ","ˈbɪskət"],"start":45.044,"end":47.824,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,45.044],[1,45.338],[2,45.657],[3,45.743],[4,46.98],[5,47.323]]},{"speaker":"kowalski","en":"He's a big boy. He needs to be careful.","vi":"Nó to xác lắm rồi. Nó cần phải cẩn thận.","ipa":["hiz","ə","bɪɡ","bɔɪ","hi","nidz","tu","bi","ˈkɛɹfəl"],"start":48.614,"end":51.774,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,48.614],[1,48.773],[2,48.866],[3,49.172],[4,50.545],[5,50.718],[6,51.024],[7,51.117],[8,51.25]]},{"speaker":"mia","en":"Don't worry. I'll put all his walks in my calendar.","vi":"Bà đừng lo. Cháu sẽ ghi hết lịch đi dạo của nó vào lịch của cháu.","ipa":["doʊnt","ˈwɝi","aɪl","pʊt","ɔl","hɪz","wɔks","ɪn","maɪ","ˈkæləndɚ"],"start":52.564,"end":56.364,"expression":"happy","react":{"kowalski":"happy"},"timing":[[0,52.564],[1,52.822],[2,54.108],[3,54.328],[4,54.561],[5,54.806],[6,55.027],[7,55.431],[8,55.541],[9,55.713]]}],"words":[{"id":"often","en":"often","ipa":"ˈɔfən","vi":"thường; thường xuyên","level":0},{"id":"twice","en":"twice","ipa":"twaɪs","vi":"hai lần; gấp đôi","level":1},{"id":"usually","en":"usually","ipa":"ˈjuʒəwəli","vi":"thường; thường thì","level":0},{"id":"hardly","en":"hardly","ipa":"ˈhɑɹdli","vi":"hầu như không; khó mà","level":1},{"id":"afraid","en":"afraid","ipa":"əˈfɹeɪd","vi":"sợ; e ngại","level":0},{"id":"walk","en":"walk","ipa":"wɔk","vi":"đi bộ; đi; cuộc đi bộ","level":0}],"focus":{"title":"Nói về tần suất và thói quen","pattern":"How often …? · twice a day · every morning · usually · hardly ever · once a week","explain":"Hỏi tần suất: \"How often does he…?\". Trả lời bằng cụm chỉ số lần: \"once/twice/three times a day/week\". Trạng từ tần suất đứng trước động từ thường: \"He usually sleeps…\", \"He hardly ever runs\" (hầu như không bao giờ), nhưng đứng sau \"be\": \"He is never hungry\".","keys":["how often","twice a day","every","usually","hardly ever","once a week"],"lines":[2,3,5,7,10,11,12]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-a2-the-dog-walker.mp3","v":"d15ecca32c","duration":57.456,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}